# LiveGrid Engineering Workflow

## MANDATORY WORKFLOW

ALL engineering tasks MUST follow this pipeline:

1. AUDIT
2. ANALYZE
3. PLAN
4. EXPLAIN RISKS
5. IMPLEMENT
6. REVIEW
7. SECURITY REVIEW
8. UI REVIEW
9. VERIFY
10. FINAL AUDIT

DO NOT skip steps.

---

